Description: Beautiful CLI network diagnostics
 xping provides live, colour-coded output for ping, traceroute, DNS,
 TLS, HTTP, WHOIS, port scanning, health scoring, speed testing, and
 more, with bash/zsh/fish completion and JSON/CSV/Markdown export on
 every command.
